{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-01-12 16:15:00', 'title': 'HYDRO SYSTEMS UNVEILS MULTI-WASHER 3000 SERIES WITH EVOCLEAN FOR ON-PREMISE LAUNDRY', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HYDRO SYSTEMS, PART OF PSG AND DOVER (NYSE: DOV), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RELEASE OF THE MULTI-WASHER 3000 SERIES WITH EVOCLEAN FOR RELIABLE CHEMICAL DISPENSING FOR ON-PREMISE LAUNDRIES.'}